{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MAGI-2 全参数指南",
    "description": "MAGI-2 整合参数接口，涵盖本文件夹内的 3 个模型。通过 model 选择模式，各模式的必填字段和限制见下文。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/videos/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "MAGI-2 全参数指南",
        "description": "MAGI-2 整合参数文档。通过 `model` 选择本文件夹内的模型；各模式的必填字段和输入要求分别列出。\n\n| 模型 ID | 模式 | 必填字段（不含 model） |\n|---|---|---|\n| `magi-2-text-to-video` | Text-to-Video | `prompt` |\n| `magi-2-image-to-video` | Image-to-Video | `image_urls` |\n| `magi-2-reference-to-video` | Reference-to-Video | `image_urls` / `video_urls` / `audio_urls` 至少一项 |\n\n### Text-to-Video\n\n- 纯文本提示词生成 1080p 视频，默认包含同步音频\n- 支持 `4`–`30` 秒任意整数时长\n\n### Image-to-Video\n\n- 输入 1 张图片生成首帧视频，输入 2 张图片生成首尾帧视频\n- 提示词选填，可仅凭首帧驱动画面\n\n### Reference-to-Video\n\n- 输入参考图片（0–10）+ 参考视频（0–5）+ 参考音频（0–5）+ 文本提示词生成视频\n- 三类参考素材至少传入一项，可任意组合\n\n- 异步处理模式，使用返回的任务ID [进行查询](/cn/api-manual/task-management/get-task-detail)\n- 生成的视频链接，有效期为7天，请尽快保存",
        "operationId": "createMagi2Video",
        "tags": [
          "视频生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoGenerationRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "text_to_video_basic": {
                  "summary": "基础文生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-text-to-video",
                    "prompt": "微距镜头对准叶片上翠绿的玻璃蛙。焦点逐渐从它光滑的皮肤，转移到它完全透明的腹部，一颗鲜红的心脏正在有力地、规律地收缩扩张。",
                    "duration": 8,
                    "quality": "1080p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                    "generate_audio": true
                  }
                },
                "text_to_video_vertical_seed": {
                  "summary": "竖屏 + 固定种子",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-text-to-video",
                    "prompt": "雨夜霓虹街头，一位身穿风衣的女子撑伞缓缓走向镜头，脚下的积水倒映着闪烁的招牌，远处传来电车驶过的声音",
                    "duration": 10,
                    "aspect_ratio": "9:16",
                    "seed": 42
                  }
                },
                "image_to_video_first_frame": {
                  "summary": "首帧图生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-image-to-video",
                    "prompt": "镜头缓缓推近，画面逐渐活起来",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/first-frame.jpg"
                    ],
                    "duration": 5,
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9"
                  }
                },
                "image_to_video_first_last_frame": {
                  "summary": "首尾帧图生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-image-to-video",
                    "prompt": "两个场景之间的流畅过渡",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/first.jpg",
                      "https://example.com/last.jpg"
                    ],
                    "duration": 6,
                    "aspect_ratio": "9:16"
                  }
                },
                "reference_to_video_multimodal": {
                  "summary": "多模态参考（图片 + 视频 + 音频）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-reference-to-video",
                    "prompt": "参考视频的运镜和节奏，让图片中的角色在城市天台上起舞，配合参考音频的节拍",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/character.jpg"
                    ],
                    "video_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/reference.mp4"
                    ],
                    "audio_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/bgm.mp3"
                    ],
                    "duration": 10,
                    "quality": "1080p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                    "generate_audio": true
                  }
                },
                "reference_to_video_image_reference": {
                  "summary": "多图参考",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-reference-to-video",
                    "prompt": "图中的两位角色在咖啡馆里相对而坐，轻声交谈",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/ref1.jpg",
                      "https://example.com/ref2.jpg"
                    ],
                    "duration": 6,
                    "aspect_ratio": "4:3"
                  }
                },
                "reference_to_video_audio_reference": {
                  "summary": "音频参考",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "magi-2-reference-to-video",
                    "prompt": "主持人面对镜头播报晨间新闻，口型与音频同步",
                    "audio_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/voice.wav"
                    ],
                    "duration": 8,
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "视频生成任务创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoGenerationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "invalid_request",
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unauthorized",
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "insufficient_quota",
                    "message": "Insufficient quota. Please top up your account.",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "model_access_denied",
                    "message": "Token does not have access to model: magi-2-text-to-video",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded",
                    "message": "Too many requests, please try again later",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "internal_error",
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "api_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "VideoGenerationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "本页汇总各模式的参数。字段是否必填、可用取值和默认值按所选 model 的说明执行；下方分别列出各模式的差异。",
        "required": [
          "model"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "视频生成模型名称\n\n| 模型 ID | 模式 | 必填字段（不含 model） |\n|---|---|---|\n| `magi-2-text-to-video` | Text-to-Video | `prompt` |\n| `magi-2-image-to-video` | Image-to-Video | `image_urls` |\n| `magi-2-reference-to-video` | Reference-to-Video | `image_urls` / `video_urls` / `audio_urls` 至少一项 |",
            "enum": [
              "magi-2-text-to-video",
              "magi-2-image-to-video",
              "magi-2-reference-to-video"
            ],
            "example": "magi-2-text-to-video"
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "**Text-to-Video**\n\n描述期望生成视频的文本提示词，支持中英文。提示词最大长度：15000 字符\n\n**注意：**\n- 本模型为纯文生视频，不支持 `image_urls`、`video_urls`、`audio_urls` 输入\n\n**Image-to-Video**\n\n描述期望生成视频的文本提示词，选填，支持中英文。提示词最大长度：15000 字符\n\n**注意：**\n- 本模型不支持 `video_urls`、`audio_urls` 输入\n\n**Reference-to-Video**\n\n描述期望生成视频的文本提示词，选填，支持中英文。提示词最大长度：15000 字符",
            "example": "参考视频的运镜和节奏，让图片中的角色在城市天台上起舞，配合参考音频的节拍"
          },
          "image_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "仅适用于： **Image-to-Video**, **Reference-to-Video**\n\n**Image-to-Video**\n\n图片 URL 数组，**1–2 张**\n\n**图片数量与行为：**\n\n| 图片数量 | 行为 | 角色 |\n|:--------:|------|------|\n| 1 张 | 首帧图生视频 | 自动设为 `first_frame` |\n| 2 张 | 首尾帧图生视频 | 第 1 张 → `first_frame`，第 2 张 → `last_frame` |\n\n**图片要求：**\n- 单张大小：不超过 `30MB`\n- 单个 URL 长度不超过 `8192` 字符\n- 仅支持 HTTPS URL，图像 URL 需要服务器能直接访问\n\n**Reference-to-Video**\n\n参考图片 URL 数组，**0–10 张**\n\n**角色说明：**\n\n| 媒体类型 | 角色 | 典型用途 |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| 图片 | `reference_image` | 角色参考、风格参考、产品图 |\n\n**图片要求：**\n- 单张大小：不超过 `30MB`\n- 仅支持 HTTPS URL，图像 URL 需要服务器能直接访问\n\n**注意：** `image_urls`、`video_urls`、`audio_urls` 至少传入一项",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "maxItems": 10,
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/ref1.jpg"
            ]
          },
          "video_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "仅适用于： **Reference-to-Video**\n\n参考视频 URL 数组，**0–5 个**\n\n**角色说明：**\n\n| 媒体类型 | 角色 | 典型用途 |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| 视频 | `reference_video` | 运镜参考、动作参考、画面风格参考 |\n\n**视频要求：**\n- 支持格式：`.mp4`、`.mov`\n- 单个视频时长：`2` ~ `30` 秒，最多 5 个，所有视频总时长 ≤ `30` 秒\n- 单个大小：不超过 `200MB`\n- 仅支持 HTTPS URL，视频 URL 需要服务器能直接访问\n\n**注意：** `image_urls`、`video_urls`、`audio_urls` 至少传入一项",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "maxItems": 5,
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/reference.mp4"
            ]
          },
          "audio_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "仅适用于： **Reference-to-Video**\n\n参考音频 URL 数组，**0–5 段**\n\n**角色说明：**\n\n| 媒体类型 | 角色 | 典型用途 |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| 音频 | `reference_audio` | 背景音乐、音效、语音/台词参考 |\n\n**音频要求：**\n- 支持格式：`.wav`、`.mp3`\n- 单段音频时长：`2` ~ `30` 秒，最多 5 段，所有音频总时长 ≤ `30` 秒\n- 单个大小：不超过 `15MB`\n- 仅支持 HTTPS URL，音频 URL 需要服务器能直接访问\n\n**注意：** `image_urls`、`video_urls`、`audio_urls` 至少传入一项",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "maxItems": 5,
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/bgm.mp3"
            ]
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "**Text-to-Video / Image-to-Video**\n\n视频时长（秒），默认为 `5` 秒\n\n**说明：**\n- 支持 `4`–`30` 秒之间的任意整数值\n- 时长与计费直接相关\n\n**Reference-to-Video**\n\n输出视频时长（秒），默认为 `5` 秒\n\n**说明：**\n- 支持 `4`–`30` 秒之间的任意整数值\n- 时长与计费直接相关",
            "default": 5,
            "minimum": 4,
            "maximum": 30,
            "example": 8
          },
          "quality": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "视频分辨率，仅支持 `1080p`",
            "enum": [
              "1080p"
            ],
            "default": "1080p",
            "example": "1080p"
          },
          "aspect_ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "**Text-to-Video / Reference-to-Video**\n\n视频宽高比，默认为 `16:9`\n\n**可选值：**\n- `16:9`（横屏）、`9:16`（竖屏）、`1:1`（方形）、`4:3`、`3:4`、`21:9`（超宽屏）\n\n**Image-to-Video**\n\n视频宽高比，默认为 `16:9`\n\n**可选值：**\n- `16:9`（横屏）、`9:16`（竖屏）、`1:1`（方形）、`4:3`、`3:4`、`21:9`（超宽屏）\n\n**说明：**\n- 输出视频按所选宽高比生成；首帧图片比例与所选宽高比不一致时，首帧会居中裁剪适配\n- 首帧为竖图时，建议传入 `9:16` 等与图片比例接近的宽高比",
            "enum": [
              "16:9",
              "9:16",
              "1:1",
              "4:3",
              "3:4",
              "21:9"
            ],
            "default": "16:9",
            "example": "16:9"
          },
          "generate_audio": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "**Text-to-Video**\n\n是否生成同步音频，默认为 `true`\n\n**可选值：**\n- `true`：视频包含同步音频（人声、音效、背景音乐），不额外收费。建议将对话部分置于双引号内以优化音频生成效果\n- `false`：输出无声视频\n\n**Image-to-Video / Reference-to-Video**\n\n是否生成同步音频，默认为 `true`\n\n**可选值：**\n- `true`：视频包含同步音频，不额外收费\n- `false`：输出无声视频",
            "default": true,
            "example": true
          },
          "seed": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "随机种子，取值范围 `0`–`4294967295`\n\n**说明：**\n- 不传时每次随机生成\n- 其他参数相同时，使用相同的种子有助于复现相近的画面",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 4294967295,
            "example": 42
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务完成后的 HTTPS 回调地址\n\n**回调时机：**\n- 任务完成（completed）、失败（failed）或取消（cancelled）时触发\n- 在计费确认完成后发送\n\n**安全限制：**\n- 仅支持 HTTPS 协议\n- 禁止回调到内网 IP 地址（127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x、192.168.x.x 等）\n- URL 长度不超过 `2048` 字符\n\n**回调机制：**\n- 超时时间：`10` 秒\n- 失败后最多重试 `3` 次（分别在失败后 `1`/`2`/`4` 秒重试）\n- 回调响应体格式与任务查询接口返回格式一致\n- 返回 2xx 状态码视为成功，其他状态码触发重试",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/webhooks/video-task-completed"
          }
        }
      },
      "VideoGenerationResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "created": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务创建时间戳",
            "example": 1761313744
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务ID",
            "example": "task-unified-1774857405-abc123"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "实际使用的模型名称",
            "example": "magi-2-text-to-video"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "video.generation.task"
            ],
            "description": "任务的具体类型"
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务进度百分比 (0-100)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100,
            "example": 0
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务状态",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "pending"
          },
          "task_info": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoTaskInfo",
            "description": "视频任务详细信息"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "image",
              "audio",
              "video"
            ],
            "description": "任务的输出类型",
            "example": "video"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoUsage",
            "description": "使用量和计费信息"
          }
        }
      },
      "VideoTaskInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "can_cancel": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "任务是否可以取消。MAGI-2 不支持用户取消任务，固定返回 `false`。",
            "example": false
          },
          "estimated_time": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "预估完成时间（秒）",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 165
          },
          "video_duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "视频时长（秒）",
            "example": 8
          }
        }
      },
      "VideoUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "使用量和计费信息",
        "properties": {
          "billing_rule": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "计费规则",
            "enum": [
              "per_call",
              "per_token",
              "per_second"
            ],
            "example": "per_second"
          },
          "credits_reserved": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "预估消耗积分数",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 50
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误代码标识符"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "视频生成",
      "description": "AI视频生成相关接口"
    }
  ]
}
